# .txt summaries, and GATE_B7_5070TI_PHASEC.md carry the numbers that matter,
# same convention as results/phaseC/*.bin above)
results/phaseC/decomp_5070ti/*.bin
results/phaseC/paired_wallclock_5070ti/decomp/*.bin

# Gate B8: SGEMM + oversubscription raw telemetry rings (large, reconstructible
